#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:9
#: 5e70c727718a4f5daaac790056204f00
msgid "Should I install from source or from packages?"
msgstr "应该从源码安装还是从软件包安装？"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:11
#: 9a357aa2933446cf8390cd1907fb8ef0
msgid ""
"`README.md` recommends **packages** for operators. That path is FSGET "
"plus `freeswitch-meta-all` (`scripts/packaging/README.md`). FSGET needs a"
" SignalWire Personal Access Token; without it, `apt` / `docker/master` "
"returns **401**."
msgstr ""
"`README.md` 建议运维人员用 **软件包**。那条路径是 FSGET 加上 `freeswitch-meta-"
"all`（`scripts/packaging/README.md`）。FSGET 需要 SignalWire Personal Access "
"Token；没有它，`apt` / `docker/master` 会返回 **401**。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:13
#: 78db81b0425f493fb00425ff3cbeef9f
msgid ""
"This clone is the **source** path: install Sofia-SIP / libks / SpanDSP / "
"signalwire-c first, then `./bootstrap.sh -j && ./configure "
"--prefix=\"$HOME/fs\" --disable-fhs && make && make install`. `release` "
"tracks packaged releases; `prerelease` tracks `master`."
msgstr ""
"本克隆走的是**源码**路径：先安装 Sofia-SIP / libks / SpanDSP / signalwire-c，再运行 "
"`./bootstrap.sh -j && ./configure --prefix=\"$HOME/fs\" --disable-fhs && "
"make && make install`。`release` 跟踪已打包发行版；`prerelease` 跟踪 `master`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:15
#: 9986488b845c4a3d8d1eaef9dd1c390b
msgid "Why are Sofia-SIP, SpanDSP, and libks missing from this git tree?"
msgstr "为什么本 git 树里没有 Sofia-SIP、SpanDSP 和 libks？"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:17
#: 6e4cb556e2d44ca7ba6f5132b9e472b1
#, fuzzy, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"They are **out-of-tree**. CI clones [sofia-"
"sip](https://github.com/freeswitch/sofia-sip); "
"`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile` also builds libks, SpanDSP, and "
"signalwire-c. macOS CI uses Homebrew `signalwire/homebrew-"
"signalwire/{libks2,signalwire-c2,spandsp}`. `configure` / link fails "
"until those libraries are installed. They are not under `libs/` (APR, "
"SRTP, ESL, VPX *are*). Sofia-SIP layout, NUA/NTA usage, and how "
"`mod_sofia` uses `nua`/`tport`: [Tech Stack](../1.architecture/02-tech-"
"stack.md#sofia-sip-library), "
"[Architecture](../1.architecture/01-architecture.md#sofia-sip-out-of-"
"tree)."
msgstr ""
"它们是 **树外** 依赖。CI 会克隆 [sofia-sip](https://github.com/freeswitch/sofia-"
"sip)；`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile` 也会构建 libks、SpanDSP 和 "
"signalwire-c。macOS CI 使用 Homebrew `signalwire/homebrew-"
"signalwire/{libks2,signalwire-c2,spandsp}`。这些库没装好时，`configure` / "
"链接会失败。它们不在 `libs/` 下（APR、SRTP、ESL、VPX *在*）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:19
#: f62fa2a17a5f4d76b9aa2b121cb5d670
#, fuzzy
msgid "What is the difference between endpoint, channel, session, and call?"
msgstr "`$${var}` 与 `${var}` 有何区别？"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:21
#: 0a794fa8370c483680f20fb3a875525e
msgid ""
"An **endpoint** is a protocol module (`mod_sofia`, `mod_verto`). A "
"**channel** is one leg (`switch_channel_t`). A **session** is the runtime"
" container around that channel (`switch_core_session_t`). A **call** is "
"one or more associated channels (typically two legs joined by a "
"**bridge**). Directory / dialplan / configuration are three separate XML "
"domains. Numbered definitions: [Overview — FS core concepts](../0"
".getting-started/01-overview.md#fs-core-concepts)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:23
#: ccf0b14b5e69483d8293bfa270d923d5
msgid "Why are there two files named `modules.conf`?"
msgstr "为什么有两个叫 `modules.conf` 的文件？"

