msgstr "`bootstrap.sh` / Autotools 会编译哪些 `src/mod/...` 树"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md
#: 0e3a3a57208b46f6a8935439b8eae54c
msgid "`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/modules.conf.xml`"
