"`uuid` is the session id for logs and `uuid_*` APIs. `state` is `CS_*`; "
"`callstate` is `CCS_*` (`ACTIVE`, `RINGING`, …). Directory user "
"(`presence_id`, `dest` on the A-leg) can differ from the SIP Contact user"
" in `name` / `callee_num` on WebRTC (often `user@….invalid`)."
msgstr ""

