"bridge](../1.architecture/05-workflows.md#worked-example-show-channels-"
"during-a-bridge). Schema: `create_channels_sql` in "
"`src/switch_core_sqldb.c`. Operator command: "
"[Runbook](../5.operations/01-runbook.md#verification-commands)."
