#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:115
#: a3773ca6491f4310af3a9e4a7daebbf8
msgid ""
"`fs_cli` client default is **`127.0.0.1:8021`** (`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`, "
"`libs/esl/fs_cli.conf`)."
msgstr ""
"`fs_cli` 客户端默认是 "
"**`127.0.0.1:8021`**（`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`、`libs/esl/fs_cli.conf`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:117
#: 86fefc7c8055479ea3f39ad74f3acbd7
msgid ""
"Commenting out `apply-inbound-acl` is **not** “no ACL”. "
"`mod_event_socket` `config()` still defaults to **`loopback.auto`** "
"(`127.0.0.0/8` and `::1/128`). Change the password and set an explicit "
"ACL before any non-loopback exposure. Wrong password closes the socket "
"(`-ERR invalid`) **after** the ACL check."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:119
#: 9c7769b2eacc459bbd2c9404e61e866d
msgid ""
"Why does `fs_cli` to the LAN IP fail with `Error Connecting []` while "
"`127.0.0.1` works?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:121
#: 8638695e49af482fad48fda2bcd73ad5
msgid ""
"The Event Socket **is** listening on 8021. SIP `rtp-ip` / `sip-ip` are "
"unrelated. The failure is ESL ACL."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:123
#: 7cb99678a2614bf9b5530300aee0ad24
msgid ""
"TCP opens, then Event Socket sends `Content-Type: text/rude-rejection` "
"and `Access Denied, go away.` — that is what `fs_cli` surfaces as `Error "
"Connecting []`. Connecting to the host LAN address (for example "
"`10.100.212.8:8021`) uses that source IP, not `127.0.0.1`, so "
"`loopback.auto` denies it. A remote laptop is denied for the same reason."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:125
#: 993972bd5b504af684d8ad30aebc10c6
msgid ""
"Allow loopback **and** the client CIDR on one list (`esl_allowed` in "
"`acl.conf.xml`), set `<param name=\"apply-inbound-acl\" "
"value=\"esl_allowed\"/>` in `event_socket.conf.xml`, then `reloadacl` and"
" `reload mod_event_socket` over **loopback**. Verify with `fs_cli -H "
"<lan-ip> -P 8021` on the FreeSWITCH box first. Full XML and commands: "
"[Remote Event Socket ACL](../5.operations/01-runbook.md#remote-event-"
"socket-acl)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:127
#: fc7cbf56598b4d8bb9220cdbd48d0dcd
msgid ""
"Do not open ESL with `0.0.0.0/0`. ESL is full control of FreeSWITCH; do "
"not leave `ClueCon` if 8021 is reachable beyond a trusted LAN."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:129
#: 9b8796360eb14ede8c9ecea23d3f0791
msgid "Why does Docker SIP or RTP fail unless I use host networking?"
msgstr "为什么不用 host 网络时 Docker 的 SIP 或 RTP 会失败？"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:131
#: 7d082b56120743e9ad5674deeb7d8b62
msgid ""
"Runtime containers expect **`--network host`** (`docker/README.md`). "
"Typical ports: SIP 5060/5080, TLS 5061/5081, Sofia SIP WebSocket "
"5066/7443, Verto WS/WSS 8081/8082, ESL **8021**, RTP UDP 16384–32768 and "
"64535–65535. Publishing those UDP ranges through a user-defined bridge is"
" the usual failure mode. Packaged images (`docker/master/Dockerfile`) "
"still need a SignalWire `TOKEN` build-arg. The token-free Debian 11 "
"source-image example (`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile`) clones "
"FreeSWITCH and its dependencies during the image build; it does not build"
" this checkout."
msgstr ""
"运行时容器需要 **`--network host`**（`docker/README.md`）。常见端口：SIP 5060/5080、TLS "
"5061/5081、Sofia SIP WebSocket 5066/7443、Verto WS/WSS 8081/8082、ESL "
"**8021**、RTP UDP 16384–32768 和 64535–65535。通过用户自定义 bridge 发布这些 UDP "
"范围是常见失败原因。打包镜像（`docker/master/Dockerfile`）仍需要 SignalWire `TOKEN` 构建参数。无 "
"token 的 Debian 11 源码镜像示例（`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile`）会在构建镜像时克隆 "
"FreeSWITCH 及其依赖；它不会构建当前 checkout。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:140
#: 877c09b1e2ae467598be3792e868b4d8
msgid "Why is WebRTC media silent over a VPN even though SIP signaling works?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:142
#: 5548d3fd01b44723af29b6f117cdf5f6
msgid ""
"Inspect the SDP answer returned by FreeSWITCH and check the `a=candidate`"
" lines. If they contain the server's public address instead of its "
"reachable VPN address (for example, `10.100.x.x`), SIP signaling may "
"succeed while RTP media cannot reach the browser. Set `ext-rtp-ip` in the"
" Sofia profile used by the call to the VPN address:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:153
#: b386281e710647ab911db724d1b5cf43
msgid ""
"`rtp-ip` selects the local RTP interface and `ext-rtp-ip` is the address "
"advertised in SDP/ICE. Reload the XML and restart the affected profile, "
"then verify the new SDP answer and confirm that the VPN permits the "
"configured RTP UDP port range. Do not change a profile used by public "
"clients to a VPN-only address unless those clients also have a route to "
"the VPN."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:159
#: fd4c4166b02f407ab9dba53d67c0750b
msgid "How do I build on Windows vs Unix?"
msgstr "Windows 和 Unix 上分别怎么构建？"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:161
#: 4a4394ddb9284f0cbf42d398cd1b78d3
msgid ""
"Unix / macOS: Autotools — `./bootstrap.sh -j && ./configure --prefix=... "
"--disable-fhs && make && make install`. Windows: `Freeswitch.2017.sln` / "
"`w32/`, typically `msbuild Freeswitch.2017.sln -t:build "
"-verbosity:minimal -property:Configuration=Release "
"-property:Platform=x64` (`msbuild.cmd` locates VS via `vswhere.exe`). CI "
"uploads `x64\\*.msi` on `master` / `v1.10` / `v1.11`. Historical "
"`src/CMakeLists.txt` is **not** the Unix CI path."
msgstr ""
"Unix / macOS：Autotools——`./bootstrap.sh -j && ./configure --prefix=... "
"--disable-fhs && make && make install`。Windows：`Freeswitch.2017.sln` / "
"`w32/`，通常使用 `msbuild Freeswitch.2017.sln -t:build -verbosity:minimal "
"-property:Configuration=Release -property:Platform=x64`（`msbuild.cmd` 通过 "
"`vswhere.exe` 定位 VS）。CI 在 `master` / `v1.10` / `v1.11` 上上传 "
"`x64\\*.msi`。历史 `src/CMakeLists.txt` **不是** Unix CI 路径。"

