msgstr "为什么本树写着 `1.11.3-dev`，而 CI 也会构建 `v1.10` / `v1.11`？"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/02-faq.md:250
#: b4adab34270f40be8114a1401063e424
msgid ""
"This workspace is **1.11.3-dev** (`AC_INIT` in `configure.ac`; keep in "
"sync with `SWITCH_VERSION_*` and `build/next-release.txt`). GitHub "
"Actions run on `master`, `v1.10`, and `v1.11`. Packaged `build.yml`: "
"those version branches → `release`; `master` → **unstable**. FSGET "
"`prerelease` tracks what you see on `master`. Verify a running binary "
"with `freeswitch -version` / `fs_cli -x version`."
msgstr ""
"本工作区是 **1.11.3-dev**（`configure.ac` 里的 `AC_INIT`；需与 `SWITCH_VERSION_*` 和 "
"`build/next-release.txt` 保持同步）。GitHub Actions 跑在 `master`、`v1.10` 和 "
"`v1.11`。打包用的 `build.yml`：那些版本分支 → `release`；`master` → **unstable**。FSGET"
" 的 `prerelease` 跟踪你在 `master` 上看到的内容。用 `freeswitch -version` / `fs_cli -x"
" version` 核对正在运行的二进制。"

